            "l": 1,
            "r": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mbappé is stuck on three. Isak, Lautaro, Gyökeres and the rest are even further back. Seven gone.",
      "say": "Embapay is stuck on three. Eesak, Lowtahro, Yurkeresh and the rest are even further back. Seven gone.",
