        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "OUT",
        "sub": "Seven of our ten · under four goals",
        "person": "mbappe",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule two. You must have won Europe's Golden Shoe, for the most league goals on the continent.",
